# 本项目所有 git 提交注释与发布注释一律中英双语。
# All git commit messages and release notes in this repository are bilingual.
#
# 格式 / Format:
#
#   <type>: <中文标题> / <English subject>
#
#   <中文正文：做了什么、为什么、怎么验证的>
#
#   <English body: what changed, why, and how it was verified>
#
# - type: feat / fix / docs / refactor / test / chore
# - 首行不超过 100 字符 / subject at most 100 columns
# - 中文在前、英文在后；两边都要完整，不互为梗概
#   Chinese first, English second; both complete, neither a summary of the other
# - 正文请删掉本提示：以 # 开头的行会被 git 自动丢弃，
#   但请保留这一行之前的空行
#   Delete these hints in the body; lines starting with # are stripped by git
#
# 发布注释 / Release notes: GitHub Release 正文必须含 `## 中文` 与 `## English`
# 两段，各自写明改动、修复与验证方式。规则详见 CONTRIBUTING.md。
# The release body must carry `## 中文` and `## English` sections, each stating
# what changed, what was fixed, and how it was verified. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# 示例 / Example:
#
#   fix: 声明配置服务而非赋值未声明名字 / declare the service instead of an undeclared name
#
#   0.4.0 用 ctx.set 发布了读者，而 Cordis 只允许赋值已声明的名字。
#   改用 ctx.provide，它声明服务并自带 disposer。
#
#   0.4.0 published its reader with ctx.set, but Cordis only lets a fiber assign
#   a name it has declared. Uses ctx.provide, which declares the service and
#   registers its own disposer.
